@@ -11,6 +11,8 @@
 
 ## Changes since v7.15.0
 
+- fix: don't try to obtain the client IP for the trusted IP check on unix socket listeners when no trusted IPs are configured or `--reverse-proxy` is disabled
+
 # V7.15.0
 
 - [#3382](https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy/pull/3382) chore(deps): update gomod and golangci/golangci-lint to v2.11.4 (@tuunit)
